c6a38c5", "type": "text", "x": 5572.5, "y": 8661.875, "width": 875.1875000000001, "height": 89.0625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-97256f223098", "roundness": null, "seed": 1265225528, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1944179826, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "✎ 261007 decided: what the Exp returns lands once, in the Block's\nobserved/eNN_<exp>/: per-arm totals, each arm naming jNN · dNN; one\nExp spans Jobs, so not a copy per Job", "originalText": "✎ 261007 decided: what the Exp returns lands once, in the Block's\nobserved/eNN_<exp>/: per-arm totals, each arm naming jNN · dNN; one\nExp spans Jobs, so not a copy per Job", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-0012391205f3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5550.0, "y": 8816.875, "width": 1875.0, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-97256f223098", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 350683178, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1253962250, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_s-1c455f6ca9f9", "type": "text", "x": 5572.5, "y": 8831.875, "width": 901.3125000000001, "height": 89.0625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-97256f223098", "roundness": null, "seed": 1158625459, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 491250867, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "✎ 261007 decided: one soft Run per Exp, run-score-<eNN>, scores every\narm's design (arithmetic on two small files); Job › Predicted vs\nobserved (s12) shows its own rows, the scorecard sums them", "originalText": "✎ 261007 decided: one soft Run per Exp, run-score-<eNN>, scores every\narm's design (arithmetic on two small files); Job › Predicted vs\nobserved (s12) shows its own rows, the scorecard sums them", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-db7f68f8a51c", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5550.0, "y": 8986.875, "width": 1875.0, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-97256f223098", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1387961284, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1320645485, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_s-545fa3a6fe3c", "type": "text", "x": 5572.5, "y": 9001.875, "width": 940.5000000000001, "height": 89.0625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-97256f223098", "roundness": null, "seed": 530316424, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 264227438, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "✎ 261007 decided: observed/ takes per-arm totals from an insight Block's\nsigned handoff, or a vendor's own per-arm report; raw Exp data stays\nin its store (it is analysis, and PHI)", "originalText": "✎ 261007 decided: observed/ takes per-arm totals from an insight Block's\nsigned handoff, or a vendor's own per-arm report; raw Exp data stays\nin its store (it is analysis, and PHI)", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 6, "textA